<h1>SP testing landscape</h1>
<p class="sub">Read it from the left: choose the door that matches your situation, pass the Research Brief, then move down through the four stages. The coloured dots on each step show which supports it relies on. Select a step, a door, or any item in the shelf below and the lines show everything it connects to.</p>
