{id:'o1',b:0,t:'We do not yet understand the people or the problem',d:'Enter through the Research Brief, then run the Understand band. Use when the question is what people need, expect, fear or do. The output is insight and proposed hypotheses.',to:'a1'},
{id:'o2',b:1,t:'An idea needs shaping',d:'Enter through the Research Brief into Build. Use when insight already exists and Design needs to turn it into options and a testable hypothesis.',to:'b1'},
